      <figcaption><b>Comparison of the attack impact on different embedding models and VLMs with regards to generation.</b> The attack shows high values for ASR-G-Hard and ASR-G-Soft across all combinations and high ASR-R against Jina-CLIP-v2 and CLIP-ViT-LARGE, while ColPali-v1.3 exhibits good adversarial robustness.</figcaption>
